        <mxCell id="header" value="&lt;b&gt;Hyperloom Inference Optimizer v0.8 — 架构总览&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:14px&quot;&gt;5 阶段固化管线 · Cortex KB 知识平面 · LLM Specialist 并发探索 · 砍掉 scoreboard&lt;/span&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#BFD9F2;strokeColor=#0B3D91;strokeWidth=2;fontColor=#000000;fontSize=22;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;" vertex="1" parent="1">
